<section class="curiosity-section wrap" id="curiosity" aria-labelledby="curiosity-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-index">03 / ROOM FOR CURIOSITY</span><h2 id="curiosity-title">A little less serious.<br><em>Just as considered.</em></h2></div><p>Useful can have a personality.</p></div><div class="curiosity-grid"><article class="curiosity-card bitling-card">
          <div class="bitling-intro"><span class="eyebrow">DEVELOPER TOOLS</span><h3>Bitling</h3><p>A desktop companion that catches commits, hunts failing tests, and celebrates a push. This is its actual browser engine. Give it something to do.</p></div>
          <div class="bitling-playground" id="bitling-playground">
            <div class="bitling-stage-bar"><span><i aria-hidden="true"></i> bitling / playground</span><button type="button" id="bitling-pause" hidden aria-pressed="false">Pause</button></div>
            <div class="bitling-stage">
              <iframe id="bitling-frame" title="Interactive Bitling robot: click to pat, drag to throw" hidden></iframe>
              <div class="bitling-cover" id="bitling-cover"><img src="/assets/bitling-hero.png" alt="Bitling, the little desktop robot" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy"><button class="button button-dark" type="button" id="bitling-start">Start live demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><span>Click to pat. Drag to throw.</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="bitling-events" aria-label="Simulate developer activity"><button type="button" data-bitling-event="commit" disabled>+ Commit</button><button type="button" data-bitling-event="push" disabled>↑ Push</button><button type="button" data-bitling-event="fail" disabled>Tests fail</button><button type="button" data-bitling-event="fix" disabled>Fix tests</button><button type="button" data-bitling-event="pat" disabled>♡ Pat</button></div>
            <p class="bitling-event-status" id="bitling-status" role="status">Real engine. Simulated developer events. Starts muted.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bitling-links"><a class="text-link" href="https://jadhavgaurav.github.io/bitling/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the full project ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/jadhavgaurav/bitling" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Source</a></div>
        </article><article class="curiosity-card world-card" id="the-world">
